   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Possible next steps",
   "text": "A good first step could be asking the MPS Society, which already supports people with Gaucher disease, whether their group could include or be copied for Parkinson's (late-onset) [E040d968]. Another step could be asking about the Krabbe Disease Global Patient Registry to see whether it could include or be copied for Parkinson's (late-onset) [E92ff8aa]. A third step could be asking about the Natural History of Glycosphingolipid Storage Disorders and Glycoprotein Disorders study, which already exists for Gaucher disease, to see whether it could include or be copied for Parkinson's (late-onset) [E750208f].",
